#38600
The Mage's Guild of Samsera~
The Mages guild takes shape of a 5 room high tower in Samsera. This tower will rpwise
mirror the other two towers in the game, the Tower of High Sorcery in Wayreth and in
SHoiken Grove. Each level will be segmented to hold a different sphere of mage 
features.
The guild will be lain out as follows:

Level1: Map Level, Link to lower room of slave chambers for mage creations. Read: The Dead
Ones from DL.

Level2: General Level
Regen Room, Shopkeeper for basic items

Level3: Training Room
Guildmaster Chamber, Pentagram Chamber for mob summonings, Scribing room for Gnome only
And one room with 2 portals to 2 other soundproof practice rooms.

Level4: Lore and Artifacts
This level will be level 10 and up and will contain the Vault, A Library of Lore, and a portal
chamber to both Midgaard (future Hightowers, and HT of sorcery in wayreth)

Level5: Challenge Chamber with board.
Battle in the Air, Battle of Wills and Knowledge.
Kurse, Oct 00'
~
