#38601
The Gate of the Mystics~
   This ornate circular antechamber is truly a ruse and not part of the Guild
at all.  If for some reason the guardian of the tower was defeated, the Mages
could hide in their guild without worry for a secret nexus point has been
established for them.  Wasn't it "friend"ly of the Archmage to go through all
this trouble for his brethren?    
~
