#38602
The Base of the Tower of the Arcane~
   You are in the very bottom of the Mage's Guild Tower, an impressive
structure which stretches a thousand feet into the sky.  The Tower is of unique
design in that it is a hollow spire, much like a straw.  Its various rooms and
secrets are located Off the main core of the tower, which you can view simply
by looking up.  Above your head, powerful sorcerers and meek apprentices float
from room to room or hover about with aid of magic.
~
