#38603
The Second Level of the Tower~
   This section of the guild that you hover in currently is used for meetings
on the guild as a whole.  Here, mages from all the orders come together to
discuss the guild and their mutual love of magic.  To the north is a chamber of
rest, where mages and their apprentices can relax and memorize spells.  To the
south lies a small shop which provides basic magical necessitites to the GUild.
  
~
