#38604
The Third Level, Guild Training~
   It is on this third level of the tower that some of the greatest Arch-Mages
began their training.  All around you here the air is electric with residual
magic from the many spells of mages new and old, honing their art.  To the
north is the Guildmaster of training, an experienced Magus that can teach you
the fundamentals of virtually any spell.  A small door lies to the east, which
leads to the guild scribing room.  A door to the south leads to a summoning
chamber, and should Always be knocked upon before entering.    
~
