#38605
The Fourth Level, Artifacts and Lore~
   So high are you in the tower now that those on the bottom floor are no
longer recognizable.  The knowledge contained in the surrounding rooms is
ancient in its origin, and accessible to only those mages who have proven
themselves to be devoted members of the conclave.  A magically sealed vault for
rare items and artifacts is to the west.  To the east is the Library of the
Occult, where some of the most powerful spellbooks of the realms are kept for
safekeeping.    
~
