#38606
The Test of Grandmaster~
   At this highest point in the tower stands a bridge which spans from the east
to the west side, allowing you to stand if you wish.  The center of the bridge
is occupied by a board and pedestal.  It is here that Magi petition to attain
the rank of Grandmaster of Magic, a rank of high standing in the guild.  The
Grandmaster must be knowledgable in all matters of the arcane, and able to hold
their own in magical combat.    
~
