#38607
The iron staircase~
   Here, an ancient staircase wrought of iron spins from the base of the tower
to the 'test laboratory'.  The walls are carved roughly from the bedrock and
are covered in odd paintings from top to bottom.  Eerie shadows dance and
flicker about from the lit torches mounted on the rock.    
~
