#38608
The Test Laboratory~
   This large cavern is not truly a laboratory so much as it is a holding cell
for those experiments gone horribly wrong.  The cavern stretches on into the
darkness as far as your vision can see, and echoes with a hollow resonance when
you speak.  Deformed creatures, minor demons, and hordes of other nasty
creatures best left forgotten down here, with a multitude of dangerous
artifacts.  It is best to return above for your own sake as soon as possible.
  
~
