#38609
The Study~
   You float into a rather lavish chamber filled with numbers of plush chairs,
thick oak tables, and books of realms lore.  Mages and their apprentices come
to this room to heal up their wounds as well as restore their depleted mental
and physical energies, a result from using magic.  The room is nearly silent,
as many are asleep, or in quiet concentration on some subject.    
~
