#38610
The Apprentice's Shop~
   The familiar smell of spell components and musty books assault your senses
as you enter this shop.  Run by the many apprentices of the Guild, it supplies
to all mages the basic tools needed for casting their magics.  You eye the many
shelves for what you need, spying some rather interesting items.    
~
