#38611
The Chamber of Magiks~
   This large room spans the whole north side of this part of the Tower, and is
where the Guildmaster teaches spells to learning magi.  The walls are covered
in hundreds of spellbooks, from the minor cantrips of a beginner, to the
monster summonings of a Thaumaturge.  Tables and racks of magical items and
components are organized about.  Many mages are here, learning enchantments,
divinations, conjurations, and sorcery.    
~
