#38612
The Scribing Room~
   This room is filled with scrolls, hordes of them.  The walls are lined with
cabinets which contain magical scrolls, all in alphabetical order.  As well,
there are reams of blank papyrus, ready for scribing.  Scribing is one of the
basic things taught to apprentices of magic, and periodically an accident
happens which results in the exploding of one or two, but this is not a common
occurence.    
~
