#38613
The Summoning Pentagram~
   This room is only used by the more powerful mages of the guild, and with
good reason: Summonings.  Few of the magical arts are as dangerous as summoning
a creature from the netherworld and binding it to your will.  Those mages which
have taken this art lightly have either died, or been taken to another plane.
The room is a place of power, with three large plateaus sequestered by lines of
sand or stone.  The central plateau contains a pentagram, used only for Gating
the most powerful of extra-planar beings.    
~
