#38614
The Spell Chamber~
   This arena-like room is located somewhere deep in the heart of the tower
away from everything else, to provide a place for magi to safely practice their
spells without fear of endangering others.  It is said that a magical shell of
silence has been placed about the room for absolute privacy.  The room is about
25' by 25', with tables and shelves for study and mixture of spell components.
~
