#38616
The Vault of Artifacts~
   This large vault of magically strengthened metal is used by the Guild of
Mages to store all manners of magical items gained upon their travels.  The
vault itself is protected by a powerful sphere of anti-magic, which prevents
any of the more dangerous items getting out of hand.  An side effect of this
however, is that enchanted objects periodically lose their enchantments.  The
guild allows use of the vault to all Mages, counting that their honor and
loyalty to the guild will prevent them from selflishly abusing it.    
~
