#38617
The Library of the Occult~
   This dark room is filled with many bookcases and cabinets of spell tomes,
lore, and other rare information know to the Conclave.  The spellbooks of some
of the most poweful Magic-Users that walk the lands are contained in this room,
though most are protected from ill use by magical enchantments on the books
themselves.  You could spend your whole life in this incredible library
studying, and still only learn a fraction of the wealth of knowledge here.    
~
