The Portal Chamber~
   You step beyond the door and enter this circular room with stone floors and
walls.  This place is where mages of great power render holes in the fabric of
space, connecting two places in the world by a portal of magic.  Two such
portals hover in the room now, crackling wildly with energy.    
~
