#38624
The Battle of Divination~
   This simple room is dominated by two circles of power.  Within each circle
stands a mage and from this point, they use their magical powers of divination
to comprehend and answer those questions posed to them by the guild.  This test
is to ascertain which mage's knowledge is greatest and whose power of
divination is stronger.    
~
